WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.408
The Media library holds website photographs and logos.

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:06.533
Search by their descriptions,

00:00:06.583 --> 00:00:10.857
then open an image to see its details and where it is used.

00:00:10.907 --> 00:00:15.401
Usage information helps you understand the effect of a change.

00:00:15.451 --> 00:00:18.919
An image that is still in use cannot be deleted.
